 xico frontier.\n\nFor many years\, O’odham activists have noticed that t
 he fight for O’odham rights and lands parallels the struggle for Palesti
 nian rights and land. Both the Tohono O’odham people and the Palestinian
 s people\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://shc.stanford.edu/stanford-huma
