DESCRIPTION:Climate Change and Counteradaptation\n\nMainstream climate res
 earch and policy often treat adaptation as a neutral\, technical process\,
  favoring top-down "adjustment" approaches. This seminar argues that these
  paradigms obscure how vulnerability in the Global South is actively produ
 ced by colonial dispossession\, racial capitalism\, and illicit financial 
 flows—ultimately pushing communities to adjust to unjust structures rath
 er than transform them. Borrowing from evolutionary biology\, where counte
 rad\n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-10-14 10:48 PDT
LOCATION:Y2E2 Building
