DESCRIPTION:What is home? In this in-person event to introduce the online 
 series for alumni called The Night Before\, we will mark the night before 
 Homecoming with a talk about how ancient and modern thinkers have conceive
 d of the idea of home. Roland Greene\, the director of the Stanford Humani
 ties Center\, will discuss some of the complexity with which the idea was 
